  "Upload Screenshots": "Subir capturas",
  "· not needed while the daily read is on": "· no hace falta mientras la lectura diaria esté activa",
  "Upload <strong>History</strong> screenshots from the game. Each screenshot can contain many players — every \"sent / took resources\" row is read and matched to its clan member automatically. Add as many screenshots as you like.": "Sube capturas del <strong>Historial</strong> del juego. Cada captura puede contener muchos jugadores — cada fila \"envió / tomó recursos\" se lee y se asocia automáticamente a su miembro del clan. Añade todas las capturas que quieras.",
  "Add screenshots by dropping, pasting, or clicking to browse": "Añade capturas arrastrándolas, pegándolas o haciendo clic para buscarlas",
  "<strong>Drop screenshots here</strong>, paste from clipboard, or {browse}": "<strong>Suelta las capturas aquí</strong>, pega desde el portapapeles o {browse}",
