  "see details": "ver detalles",
  "No scans yet.": "Aún no hay escaneos.",
  "No chests recorded for this scan.": "No se registraron cofres en este escaneo.",
  "⏱ No receive-times captured — \"Received\" fell back to the scan time. If you want accurate times, check the Gifts {calibration} crop includes the \"Time left\" countdown.": "⏱ No se capturaron horas de recepción — \"Recibido\" usó la hora del escaneo. Si quieres horas precisas, comprueba que el recorte de {calibration} de Regalos incluya la cuenta atrás \"Tiempo restante\".",
  "calibration": "calibración",
  "Chests Captured ({count})": "Cofres capturados ({count})",
