  "DB restored from {file}. Pre-restore snapshot saved as {snapshot}.": "BD restaurada desde {file}. Instantánea previa guardada como {snapshot}.",
  "Restore complete": "Restauración completada",
  "Only super admins can change scanner settings.": "Solo los superadmins pueden cambiar los ajustes del escáner.",
